    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B01b1 scope (user module)","items":["Covers user module (~33 routes est.) as grouped endpoint flows. B01b split: B01b1 user, B01b2 rbac/security-policy/tenant-idp-config pending.","Admin user routes include /admin/users management (export, bulk-actions, profile, settings, reset-password, roles, departments, voice-profiles sub-resources as present in controller) and admin user department assignment endpoints.","Self-service routes include /users/me/preferences, /users/me/settings, /users/me/departments, /users/:id/roles view path (controller order-sensitive), and password flows: POST forgot-password, POST /users/password-reset/complete."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Admin user update: PATCH /admin/users/:id/profile or settings with user/profile/settings DTO; output user/profile/setting response.","User settings: GET/PATCH /users/me/settings[/:namespace/:key] with settings payload; output effective settings values.","Department/role assignment: POST/PATCH/DELETE assignment endpoints with assignment IDs/role/department payloads; output assignment records.","Password reset: forgot-password accepts identifier/email DTO; reset complete accepts token/new password DTO. Exact schemas/side effects (email/token issuance) should be verified against DTOs/services/tests."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence and limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Controller/service sources verified in local tree.","Downstream represented as identity/user data store (Postgres/Prisma via application services). Password reset may involve additional token/email infrastructure; confirm in implementation before treating as complete contract.","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes for readability; example I/O summarized from route contracts; route count should be reconciled against catalog/inventory for strict 1:1 endpoint coverage."]}
  ]
